<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Oil and helixien are FOUND, never built (OILGAS_BUILDABILITY_EXCISE_FOUND_NOT_FORGED).

     Owner adoption rulings, design/Jawa/mods/required_mods.md: Rimefeller (2026-08-04) "place pre-built + strip
     buildability (remove <designationCategory>) so it can only be found"; Vanilla Helixien Gas Expanded (2026-08-10)
     "a cool thing to find added to the tile map, not as an infinite source", with the pump stripped of buildability.
     Guardrail: desert_world_design.md section 2A (no player-buildable infinite generator of a windfall resource).

     WHY AN EMPTY NODE AND NOT A REMOVE: every Rimefeller work below inherits designationCategory from an abstract
     parent (BasedRimefellerMom, ChemfuelHopperBase); none declares its own, so a PatchOperationRemove on the child
     matches nothing. An empty <designationCategory/> on the child overrides the parent's, and an empty def node
     loads as null (Verse.DirectXmlToObject: InnerText.NullOrEmpty() sets the field null). Rimefeller uses the same
     form itself on Filth_OilSlick. Each def gets a Conditional, so a future version that declares the field
     directly is replaced, never doubled ("defines the same field twice").

     WHY UNBUILDABLE AND NOT DELETED: the mods' own C#, research and pipe nets keep every reference intact; a
     pre-placed (found) well, cracker or pump still works.

     The whole file is gated by the Doctrine Mod Setting "oilWorksFoundNotBuilt" (default on; acts after a restart).
     The infinite helixien deposits are removed in C# (HelixienFinite.cs), gated by "noInfiniteHelixien".
     Offline check: src/RimUtinni/Doctrine/selftest_found_not_forged.py. -->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="RimMandrake.Utinni.Doctrine.PatchOperationDoctrineSetting">
    <setting>oilWorksFoundNotBuilt</setting>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>

        <li Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
          <mods><li>Rimefeller</li></mods>
          <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
            <operations>
              <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
                <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="OilWell" or defName="DeepOilWell" or defName="OilStorage" or defName="CrudeCracker" or defName="RefineryLoadingBay"][not(designationCategory)]</xpath>
                <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
                  <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="OilWell" or defName="DeepOilWell" or defName="OilStorage" or defName="CrudeCracker" or defName="RefineryLoadingBay"][not(designationCategory)]</xpath>
                  <value>
                    <designationCategory></designationCategory>
                  </value>
                </match>
              </li>
              <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
                <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="OilWell" or defName="DeepOilWell" or defName="OilStorage" or defName="CrudeCracker" or defName="RefineryLoadingBay"]/designationCategory[text()]</xpath>
                <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
                  <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="OilWell" or defName="DeepOilWell" or defName="OilStorage" or defName="CrudeCracker" or defName="RefineryLoadingBay"]/designationCategory[text()]</xpath>
                  <value>
                    <designationCategory></designationCategory>
                  </value>
                </match>
              </li>
            </operations>
          </match>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
          <mods><li>Vanilla Helixien Gas Expanded</li></mods>
          <match Class="PatchOperationConditional">
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VHGE_HelixienPump"]/designationCategory[text()]</xpath>
            <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
              <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VHGE_HelixienPump"]/designationCategory[text()]</xpath>
              <value>
                <designationCategory></designationCategory>
              </value>
            </match>
          </match>
        </li>

      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
